  "id": "predictive-testing",
  "term": "predictive testing",
  "definition": "Predictive testing is genetic testing used in cancer risk assessment to help identify whether family members may have an inherited predisposition to cancer. It is used so that prevention, screening, surveillance, or management can be planned more appropriately.",
